  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Leather Strip (x3), Thread Spool (x2), Sinew (x1)

